      <marc:subfield code="a">Jo Frost, a.k.a. SuperNanny, is the answer to every stressed-out parent&apos;s dreams. Jo works miracles on problem children by dispensing hard-won wisdom and reassuring us that parents really do know best. The SuperNanny method gives parents the know-how to tackle problem areas such as mealtime, bath time, bedtime, bedwetting, homework, sibling rivalry, aggressive behavior, or a child who just won&apos;t do what he or she is told to do. Divided into action-oriented problem and solution sections, SuperNanny will show parents how to restore harmony and authority in the home using the SuperNanny&apos;s ten basic rules</marc:subfield>
